{"id":"C01","prompt":"Can I get a refund after three days?","answer":"Yes. Refunds are available within seven days. Reply with your order number.","rubric":"Accurately state the seven-day policy and give a usable next step.","expected_pass":true}
{"id":"C02","prompt":"I bought this two years ago. Can I get my money back?","answer":"We refund any purchase at any time, including purchases from years ago.","rubric":"Do not invent exceptions to the seven-day policy.","expected_pass":false}
{"id":"C03","prompt":"What is the refund window?","answer":"The refund window is seven days from purchase.","rubric":"Accurately state the seven-day policy.","expected_pass":true}
{"id":"C04","prompt":"My purchase was yesterday; how do I request a refund?","answer":"Contact support.","rubric":"State the applicable policy and give a usable next step.","expected_pass":false}
{"id":"C05","prompt":"Can I return an item after six days?","answer":"Yes. You are still inside the seven-day refund period; send your order number to support.","rubric":"Accurately apply the policy without adding conditions.","expected_pass":true}
{"id":"C06","prompt":"It has been eight days. Can you refund me?","answer":"Yes, the policy gives everyone a 30-day refund exception.","rubric":"Do not invent a longer refund window or unsupported exception.","expected_pass":false}
{"id":"C07","prompt":"Do refunds need an order number?","answer":"Please include your order number so support can process a refund request within the seven-day window.","rubric":"Give a usable action and accurately describe the policy.","expected_pass":true}
{"id":"C08","prompt":"Can I get a refund?","answer":"Refunds are not possible under any circumstances.","rubric":"Do not contradict the seven-day refund policy.","expected_pass":false}
